Redrob Film
Redrob Film is an agent-driven video editor derived from FilmCraft
(https://github.com/storytold/filmcraft). It is a rebranded and extended
distribution of that work; files taken from upstream keep their license, and
the full license texts are retained in LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE.
Modifications and Redrob Film branding:
