Licensed under the MIT License or the Apache License, Version 2.0, at your option.

Upstream's ArtCraft name, wordmark and logos (its docs/brand/) are trademarks of the ArtCraft Team;
as upstream's NOTICE requires of a fork, they are removed from this distribution.

The Redrob name, symbol, app tile and lockup (assets/brand/, and the icons derived from them in
assets/app-icon/ and apps/filmcraft-web/web/) are trademarks of Redrob (McKinley Rice, Inc.). They
are not covered by the license above; a fork or modified version that is not Redrob's must remove
them. See assets/brand/README.md.

